--- crates/iwe/README.md
64: ### `find`
65: Search and discover documents.
66: 
67: ```bash
68: iwe find                           # list all documents
69: iwe find "search query"            # fuzzy match on title and key
70: iwe find --roots                   # only root documents (no incoming refs)
71: iwe find --refs-to project         # documents referencing "project"
72: iwe find --refs-from project       # documents referenced by "project"
73: iwe find -l 10                     # limit results
74: iwe find -f json                   # output as JSON
75: ```
76: 
77: Options:
78: - `--roots` - only root documents (no incoming block refs)
79: - `--refs-to <KEY>` - documents that reference this key
80: - `--refs-from <KEY>` - documents referenced by this key
81: - `-l, --limit <N>` - maximum results
82: - `-f, --format <FORMAT>` - output format: `markdown` (default), `keys`, `json`
83: 
84: ### `retrieve`
85: Retrieve document content with configurable expansion.
86: 
